了\n但是有些人就是喜欢圈养这个玩法🥹🙌🏻（我）\n控制好时间，程度什么的，其实还好的。像也有只持续一两周的圈养，结束后继续回到原来相处模式的主奴……\n圈养跟包养还是有区别的🙌🏻","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113976860237578377"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T12:27:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113970714034532715"],"id":"2113970714034532715","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":15083,"like_count":124,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"首先我觉得那篇sub圈养帖子的贴主有问题，并不是维护。他描述的“被圈养的幸福生活”具有误导性，会让不知情者忽视圈养的危险。\n\n先说他对下位的要求的话，其实我能理解\n因为这些就是圈养的基本项（离开上位就会死除外）（其实我以为是夸张来着）","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113970714034532715"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T11:41:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113958989604216995"],"id":"2113958989604216995","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2108,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天来后室玩 https://t.co/RP5Wd5VcN5","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113958989604216995"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T06:12:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113876182194409800"],"id":"2113876182194409800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2082,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113662858114572625","type":"quoted"}],"text":"推特以为我要自杀我不行了 https://t.co/RtsCCRmML3 https://t.co/evvy2q2Pbk","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113876182194409800"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T06:05:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113874615768633491"],"id":"2113874615768633491","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10068,"like_count":150,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113608365717033222","type":"quoted"}],"text":"觉得女生傻逼活该自找的，我只能说你指望一个十四岁未成年的女生成熟到哪里去，认知高到哪里去，心智成熟到哪里去。\n她再成熟认知再高心智再成熟也还是一个未成年。她懂这件事跟她是否能做到不去做这件事也是两回事\npua洗脑未成年本来就是一个容易到不能再容易的事\n“做爱跟用小玩具是一样的” https://t.